Task-Name: amerika-live
Task-Description: Amerika OS live session
Task-Long-Description: Extras for the Amerika OS live installation image: the live-boot support from
 casper, the Calamares installer with Amerika's configuration, disk and filesystem tools for repairing
 or preparing a machine, and the hook that logs the live user into the Amerika session.
 This package belongs on the live image only; the installer removes it from the installed system.
Section: metapackages

Depends:
 * amerika-desktop
 * amerika-installer-config
 * casper
 * gparted
 * ntfs-3g
 * exfatprogs
 * efibootmgr
 * mokutil
 * dmidecode

Recommends:
 * network-manager-gnome
 * hwe-qcom-x1e-meta
